<- {"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"session/update","params":{"sessionId":"session-acp-replay-0001","update":{"sessionUpdate":"available_commands_update","availableCommands":[{"name":"plan","description":"Turn plan mode on.","input":null},{"name":"mcp","description":"Show the status of the MCP servers, or reconnect them.","input":{"hint":"[reconnect]"}},{"name":"skills","description":"List available skills.","input":null},{"name":"status","description":"Display session configuration and token usage.","input":null},{"name":"review","description":"Review uncommitted changes, or review with custom instructions.","input":{"hint":"optional review instructions"}},{"name":"review-branch","description":"Review changes relative to a base branch.","input":{"hint":"branch name"}},{"name":"review-commit","description":"Review a specific commit.","input":{"hint":"commit sha"}},{"name":"compact","description":"Summarize conversation to avoid hitting the context limit.","input":null},{"name":"goal","description":"Set a goal to keep pursuing.","input":{"hint":"[<objective>|clear|pause|resume]"}},{"name":"rename","description":"Rename the current session.","input":{"hint":"new name"}},{"name":"logout","description":"Sign out of Codex. This option is available when you are logged in via ChatGPT.","input":null},{"name":"$agent-sandbox","description":"在单机 Linux 上跑 agent 生成或不可信代码的沙箱选型与执行：bubblewrap（约 30ms，可信代码）、gVisor runsc（约 100ms，不可信代码）、microsandbox microVM（独立内核、快照与 fork）、以及 Docker 热容器（约 120ms/次）。用户说\"跑一下这段代码/测试\"、\"别污染宿主\"、\"Docker 太慢/太重\"、\"要隔离\"、\"sandbox\"、\"microVM\"、\"gVisor\"、\"bwrap\"、\"起个干净环境\"时使用。","input":null},{"name":"$codex-cli-calling","description":"Use when the user wants to invoke Codex directly from a terminal without opening the interactive TUI, including one-shot tasks, repository edits, shell scripts, stdin pipelines, CI/automation, structured JSON output, or resuming a non-interactive session. Covers `codex exec`, working-directory and sandbox selection, output capture, JSONL/schema output, and safe automation. 触发场景：用户询问如何在 CLI/命令行里直接调用 Codex 做事、非交互执行任务、脚本或管道调用 Codex、让 Codex 自动修改项目、获取机器可读结果。","input":null},{"name":"$desktop-compute","description":"调用局域网那台推理机（`ssh desktop` = 192.168.0.108，Windows 11 + RX 7900 XTX 24G + ROCm 7.2）的算力：唤醒/状态体检、远程跑 PowerShell 与 GPU 任务、长任务托管（schtasks SYSTEM）、传大文件、控 llama-router 服务、以及后续模型微调训练的落位与前置检查。用户说\"用那台电脑/推理机/7900XTX 跑一下\"\"desktop 上执行\"\"远程 GPU\"\"传文件到推理机\"\"开/关 llama 服务\"\"做微调/训练/LoRA\"时使用。本机（只有 BMC 显卡）算不了 GPU 活，必须走这里。 触发：需要 GPU/大内存/Windows 专属环境，或要把重活挪出本机时。也用于推理机连不上（睡眠）时的唤醒与排障。","input":null},{"name":"$dsh-cli-calling","description":"Drive local DeepSeek Harness (dsh) through its CLI for one-shot tasks, delegated coding and test repairs, NDJSON usage accounting, session continuation, session status and steering, or profile inspection. 触发：用 dsh 干活、让 dsh 编码/跑测试/修到通过/干脏活、headless 派单、续 dsh 会话、查看 dsh 会话状态/是否卡住、给 dsh 会话发消息或打断、查看 dsh 配置或插件。包括限定改动范围、原会话返工和主会话独立验收。","input":null},{"name":"$grok-cli-calling","description":"Use when the user wants to invoke the Grok CLI from the command line without entering the interactive TUI — one-shot quick queries, scripting/piping, non-interactive task execution, structured JSON output, or resuming a session. Covers `grok -p/--single` prompt mode, --output-format, --json-schema, -m model override, -c/--continue and -r/--resume, --permission-mode/--sandbox, and subcommands (agent, sessions, export, memory, mcp, plugin, doctor, login). 触发场景：用户在命令行直接让 Grok 干活、不进交互界面、快速一次性提问、写脚本调用、管道传参、非交互调用 grok。","input":null},{"name":"$hermes-cli-calling","description":"Use when the user wants to invoke Hermes Agent from the command line without entering the interactive TUI — one-shot queries, scripting/piping, non-interactive task execution. Covers hermes chat -q / hermes -z, common flags (-Q, --max-turns, -t, -s, -m, --image, --yolo, -c/--resume), pipe usage, and alternative non-interactive surfaces (cron, send, proxy, acp). 触发场景:用户在命令行直接让 Hermes 干活、不进交互界面、写脚本调用、管道传参、定时任务。","input":null},{"name":"$home-machines","description":"调度局域网里本机之外的 3 台电脑——`desktop`（192.168.0.108，Win11 + RX 7900 XTX 24G 算力机）、`eve116`（192.168.0.116，Win11 主力机）、`debian`（192.168.0.50，Debian 13 笔记本 + USB 采集卡）。统一入口 `node.sh`：查状态、远程跑命令/多行脚本、传取文件、WoL 唤醒、debian 的 root 通道。用户说\"家里其他电脑/那几台机器/远程跑一下/传文件到 108/116/50/推理机/新电脑/笔记本/唤醒它\"时使用。 触发：需要在任何一台家里远端机器上执行命令、传文件、查状态或唤醒时；也用于判断某个活该派给哪台机器、以及它们各自的红线。","input":null},{"name":"$kimi-cli-calling","description":"Use when the user wants to invoke Kimi Code CLI from the command line without entering the interactive TUI — one-shot queries, scripting/piping, non-interactive task execution. Covers `kimi -p` prompt mode, --output-format, -m model override, -c/--session resume, --skills-dir/--agent/--add-dir/--plan, and subcommands (acp, web, export, login, doctor, vis, upgrade). 触发场景:用户在命令行直接让 Kimi 干活、不进交互界面、写脚本调用、管道传参、非交互调用 kimi。","input":null},{"name":"$openai-templates:artifact-template-analytics-dashboard","description":"Create a spreadsheet using the Analytics Dashboard template and its retained reference file. Use when the user selects or names Analytics Dashboard. Monitor acquisition, engagement, retention, revenue, and conversion funnel KPIs with charts.","input":null},{"name":"$openai-templates:artifact-template-business-review","description":"Create a presentation using the Business Review template and its retained reference file. Use when the user selects or names Business Review. Review business performance, KPIs, segment results, strategic priorities, decisions, and outlook.","input":null},{"name":"$openai-templates:artifact-template-design-report","description":"Create a document using the Design Report template and its retained reference file. Use when the user selects or names Design Report. Produce design reports with an executive summary, key findings, implications, recommendations, and appendix.","input":null},{"name":"$openai-templates:artifact-template-experiment-analysis","description":"Create a document using the Experiment An